      "blocking_effect": "Every next-fresh DUT-simulation package must use DUMP_VCD=0/DUMP_FSDB=0/TB_DUMP_FSDB=0 and reject VPD/FSDB/VCD/FST or dump/query assets. The exact final ZIP must bind a source-derived 26-role actual-signal catalog, pairwise-distinguishing candidate-by-boundary matrix, ordered unbounded four-state event chunks, end states, simulation-time heartbeat, canonical parser/decision and exact return member set. Decimal 100000000 bytes is warning-only for observer evidence and never a hard cap. The exact package_tools/server_post_sim_return.py may retain only contract-bound inert historical suffix literals when its bytes equal the canonical helper and the exact request omits/nulls waveform_discovery; writer/control scans and all active surfaces remain fail-closed. The generic child-subreaper supervisor must terminate and reap the simulator tree and close/flush observer chunks before publication. Compile-not-started preserves the independent compile-core exemption; simulation-started incomplete observer evidence fails closed while retaining partial observer/core return.",
